# First Alliance ram from Veron Amberstill (Amberstill Ranch).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: one Riding skill (Apprentice 75 from level 40, Journeyman 150
# at 60). Training costs 100g and 1,000g (Forever's world data: the trainers of
# Velma Warnam and Genn Fairweather, build 70124) and comes with a mount
# (Blizzard). ItemSparse lists the mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60)
# for every race of the faction, but each one also needs Ram Riding (826;
# MountCapability), which SkillLineAbility gives only Dwarves with Riding: the
# faction's other races and the Skyborne must learn it.
# ASSUMED: Ultham Ironhorn teaches it to them at Exalted with Ironforge (Classic
# rule; a beta player guide says other races' mounts need Exalted). In-game
# check: a Human at Ultham Ironhorn, with and without Exalted.
# ASSUMED: Honored with your race's home city takes 10% off training and mounts
# (beta player guides; Classic had the same). In-game check: the price at Honored.

step Learn to ride
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Amberstill Ranch is east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan; Ultham Ironhorn stands beside Veron Amberstill's rams. At 40 Ultham Ironhorn teaches Riding to Dwarves for 100g (10% less at Honored with Ironforge), and it comes with a ram. Other races learn Riding, with their own first mount, at their own race's riding trainer.
  level 40
  train 4772 only Dwarf               -- Ultham Ironhorn, riding trainer
  skill Riding 75

step Ram Riding for other races
  only Human,NightElf,Gnome,Skyborne
  when !knows 826
  tip Any Alliance race can buy these rams, but riding one also takes Ram Riding, which only Dwarves get with Riding. Ultham Ironhorn teaches it to other races once they are Exalted with Ironforge (the Ironforge Reputation guide shows the way). Until then, don't buy a ram for this character.
  rep "Ironforge" Exalted
  train 4772                          -- Ultham Ironhorn, Ram Riding

step Pick a colour
  tip Veron Amberstill sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 1261                         -- Veron Amberstill
  buy 5864 npc 1261 optional          -- Gray Ram, 20g
  buy 5872 npc 1261 optional          -- Brown Ram, 20g
  buy 5873 npc 1261 optional          -- White Ram, 20g
